        "summary": "Implement payment webhook dispatcher",
        "description": "Implement the core webhook dispatcher service that sends HTTP POST notifications to registered merchant endpoints when payment events occur. Must support event types: payment.authorized, payment.captured, payment.refunded, payment.failed, payment.chargeback. The dispatcher reads from Kafka topic 'mfs.payment.events' and delivers to merchant-registered URLs stored in mfs_payments_db on pghost-prod-01.mfs.internal. Uses svc-webhook-dispatch service account.\n\nAcceptance Criteria:\n- Delivery latency < 500ms p95\n- Support HMAC-SHA256 signature verification\n- Configurable retry policy per merchant\n- Deploy to mfs-pay-pod-01, mfs-pay-pod-02\n\nGitLab MR: !601\nChange Request: CHG0090401\nTest Cases: TC-PAY-009, TC-PAY-010",
